// OoT's buttons for the bindings' descriptions on the Controls tab (ui_text.c oot_bind): what the game's own controller
// guide in its pause menu gives each button (A actions and, held, the dash; X jump; Y attack; ZL target; ZR the item;
// L and R switch items; the right stick's press resets the camera; the d-pad's four), in each menu language. One row per
// language, the entries in oot_bind_ids' order: A, B, X, Y, the left and right sticks' presses, L, R, ZL, ZR, +, -,
// the d-pad. ui_text.c's own entries for these ids are TotK's.
